#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/lb.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can provision VM or Container HaProxy Load Balancers, Amazon "
"Elastic and Application Load Balancers, Azure Load Balancers, and integrates"
" with several external Load Balancers, including F5, Citrix, and AVI."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| puede provision VM o Contenedor HaProxy Balanceadores de carga, "
"Amazon Elastic y Aplicación Balanceadores de carga, Azure Balanceadores de "
"carga, y integrates con varios externo Balanceadores de carga, incluyendo "
"F5, Citrix, y AVI."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/lb.rst:11
msgid ""
"Once created or integrated, Load Balancers are available as an option to be "
"added during provision time or post-provisioning."
msgstr ""
"Once creado o integrated, Balanceadores de carga están disponibles como un "
"opción a be agregado durante provision tiempo o post-provisioning."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/lb.rst:13
msgid ""
"Once a Load Balancer is added to an instance, you can manually scale or "
"configure auto-scaling based on thresholds or schedules, and burst across "
"clouds with cloud priority."
msgstr ""
"Once un Balanceador de carga es agregado a un instance, you puede "
"manualmente scale o configure auto-scaling basado en thresholds o schedules,"
" y burst a través de clouds con cloud priority."

