#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/policies.rst:4
msgid "Load Balancer Policies and Rules"
msgstr "Load Balancer Policies y Rules"

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/policies.rst:9
msgid ""
"Load Balancer Policies define traffic management rules that control how "
"requests are routed, redirected, or modified by the load balancer. Policies "
"contain one or more rules, and each rule can match on specific conditions "
"(such as URI path, hostname, or header values) and perform actions (such as "
"forwarding to a pool, redirecting, or rewriting)."
msgstr ""
"Balanceador de carga Policies define traffic gestión reglas ese control cómo"
" solicitudes son routed, redirected, o modified por el load balancer. "
"Policies contener one o más reglas, y cada regla puede match en específico "
"conditions (como URI ruta, hostname, o header valores) y perform acciones "
"(como forwarding a un pool, redirecting, o rewriting)."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/policies.rst:11
msgid ""
"Policy management is available for load balancer types that support policy-"
"based routing (such as F5 BIG-IP and NSX-T)."
msgstr ""
"Policy gestión está disponible para load balancer tipos ese support "
"política-based routing (como F5 BIG-IP y NSX-T)."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/policies.rst:16
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Load Balancers`` role permission at **Full** level is "
"required to create, edit, or delete policies and rules."
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure: Load Balancers`` permiso de rol en **Full** nivel es "
"requerido a crear, editar, o eliminar políticas y reglas."

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/policies.rst:17
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Load Balancers`` role permission at **Read** level allows "
"viewing policies and rules only."
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure: Load Balancers`` permiso de rol en **Read** nivel permite "
"viewing políticas y reglas solo."

